<title>JAPAN: Japan Nov housing starts up 9.9 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Japan Nov housing starts up 9.9 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-12-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's housing starts in November were up 9.9 percent from a year earlier to 150,749 units, the Construction Ministry said on Thursday.</p>
<p>					Nov starts   yr/yr pct change</p>
<p> Private homes			57,256	  +24.6</p>
<p> Rental homes			 61,862	  +10.4</p>
<p> Employee housing		   2,183	    -5.7</p>
<p> Housing built for sale	   29,448	  -10.4</p>
<p>  (Condominiums)		    16,990	  -11.8</p>
<p> Total				 150,749	   +9.9</p>
</text>
